	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Lists the window groups defined in machine-local git config
(workspace.&lt;name&gt;.window) and opens one.

All logic lives in ~/bin/worktabs — this workflow is two calls into
it, so there is nothing here to keep in sync. Alfred runs scripts with
/bin/zsh --no-rcs and a fixed PATH that excludes ~/bin, which is why
both scripts use an absolute $HOME/bin/worktabs.

  ws        list the groups, hit return to open one
